## Down

::vfx{type="ashFall"}
::music{playback="fadeOut"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: It does not hurt as much as she expected. It hurts exactly as much as she feared.
@narrator{code="0020"}: Floor {{run.floor}}. The steps go by upward, very fast, and then there are no steps at all.
@wren{code="0010" mono}: Warm stone. I remember warm stone.
